00:24.589 --> 00:25.189
[SPEAKER_02]: I'm just curious.

00:25.890 --> 00:31.533
[SPEAKER_02]: Blessing, normally we have these religious connotations, but it's one of the whole points of,

00:33.206 --> 00:40.792
It's like I improve in some form or another.

00:41.772 --> 00:50.819
[SPEAKER_02]: So I'm curious what you mean by that term and then how that relates to my personal development.

