02:17.642 --> 02:39.330
[SPEAKER_01]: So of course, when we speak of blessing, if we just like it would be just putting again and again a vase, an empowerment vase upon the head of the disciple, and if we expect that just that gesture will free our mind stream, that's probably wishful thinking.

02:39.630 --> 02:40.871
[SPEAKER_01]: It's not going to happen like that.

02:41.891 --> 02:45.753
[SPEAKER_01]: And so what we need there is first of all, of course, an authentic teacher.

02:46.273 --> 03:06.185
[SPEAKER_01]: but also that while we are receiving empowerment through those symbolic gestures and symbolic objects which have been blessed, then we ourselves go through all the sort of proper visualization with the right attitude, with the right motivation, with the right amount of pure vision and devotion.

03:07.025 --> 03:12.650
[SPEAKER_01]: And then something will happen in the sense of what we mean.

03:12.730 --> 03:29.226
[SPEAKER_01]: Happening means a kind of transformation to our concentration, openness, devotion, and sort of attuning oneself to both the enlightened nature of the teacher's mind and our own basic nature.

03:29.866 --> 03:32.348
[SPEAKER_01]: And so then some kind of transmission can happen.

03:33.029 --> 03:38.091
[SPEAKER_01]: But it's not just like a sort of mechanical blessing by putting some object on one's head.

03:39.431 --> 03:47.013
[SPEAKER_01]: So I'm just going to do some commitments to go.

03:47.873 --> 03:49.954
[SPEAKER_01]: Last question.

03:50.654 --> 03:52.135
[SPEAKER_01]: Among those you think most important.

03:55.896 --> 04:01.378
