06:47.360 --> 06:49.322
[SPEAKER_01]: So there are many kinds of teachers all over the place.

06:49.702 --> 06:59.790
[SPEAKER_01]: So what matters is not how many disciples they have, how eloquent they are in the way they teach, the way they speak, whether they speak beautifully or not.

07:00.171 --> 07:03.333
[SPEAKER_01]: What really matters is their true realization.

07:03.473 --> 07:08.037
[SPEAKER_01]: And especially if we look in the scriptures, there are many clear descriptions of what is an authentic teacher.

07:08.498 --> 07:09.538
[SPEAKER_01]: So is that teacher...

07:10.900 --> 07:14.143
[SPEAKER_01]: Is he or she in accordance with those characteristics?

07:14.563 --> 07:15.804
[SPEAKER_01]: That's quite easy to find.

07:15.824 --> 07:17.245
