07:17.866 --> 07:20.669
[SPEAKER_01]: So that is a very important thing.

07:21.509 --> 07:25.113
[SPEAKER_01]: And so we have to be careful and examine the teacher.

07:25.293 --> 07:33.500
[SPEAKER_01]: Once we have found the teacher which we deem to be authentic, then give our trust and then practice according to his or her instructions.

